    <h3 id="beach-photography">4. Beach portrait and proposal photography</h3>
    <p>Sunset sessions at La Jolla Cove, Coronado and Sunset Cliffs are a steady market for family portraits, engagements and proposals, especially from visitors. A strong Instagram presence and a fast turnaround on edited galleries win bookings.</p>
